A new link to House. Any link you sent before stops letting anyone new in; everyone it let in stays.
It works for a day, while this computer is on:

  svrngs://join/<the link>

or, to open it in a browser:

  http://127.0.0.1:57231/#<the link>

On a phone, every app opens under http://localhost:57231/: they share it, so an app there can see what another keeps there.

Leave this running; Ctrl-C stops it.
